const translatedFooterParagraphs={"es": {"MarginForge is a Marketplace Profit & Pricing Engine by bumblebee-46. Use Selling Price Engine to find a target price, or Margin Engine to review profit at a current price. Calculations use the agreed v2.1 marketplace rules.": "MarginForge es un motor de precios y beneficios de bumblebee-46. Usa el motor de precios para encontrar un precio con margen objetivo o el motor de márgenes para evaluar un precio actual. Los cálculos siguen las reglas acordadas v2.1.", "Product inputs and bulk calculations are processed in your browser. This app does not upload your product data to a server. Theme preferences, fee profiles and single-product inputs (including product identifiers and costs) are stored in this browser. Inputs are saved separately for each marketplace and country. Reset product replaces the current saved inputs. Bulk data is not saved by the input-memory feature. Google Fonts is requested from its provider; that request exposes standard connection information such as your IP address. Interface language preferences are stored in this browser. Exported files are downloaded locally.": "Los datos de producto y cálculos por lotes se procesan en tu navegador; no se envían a un servidor. Tema, idioma, perfiles e inputs individuales (identificadores y costes) se guardan en este navegador, separados por plataforma y país. Restablecer producto sustituye los datos actuales. Esta función no guarda datos por lotes. Google Fonts recibe datos de conexión como tu IP. Los archivos exportados se descargan localmente."}, "fr": {"MarginForge is a Marketplace Profit & Pricing Engine by bumblebee-46. Use Selling Price Engine to find a target price, or Margin Engine to review profit at a current price. Calculations use the agreed v2.1 marketplace rules.": "MarginForge est un moteur de prix et de bénéfices créé par bumblebee-46. Utilisez le moteur de prix pour atteindre une marge cible ou le moteur de marge pour évaluer un prix actuel. Les calculs suivent les règles convenues v2.1.", "Product inputs and bulk calculations are processed in your browser. This app does not upload your product data to a server. Theme preferences, fee profiles and single-product inputs (including product identifiers and costs) are stored in this browser. Inputs are saved separately for each marketplace and country. Reset product replaces the current saved inputs. Bulk data is not saved by the input-memory feature. Google Fonts is requested from its provider; that request exposes standard connection information such as your IP address. Interface language preferences are stored in this browser. Exported files are downloaded locally.": "Les données produit et calculs par lot restent dans votre navigateur ; ils ne sont pas envoyés à un serveur. Thème, langue, profils et données individuelles (identifiants et coûts) sont enregistrés dans ce navigateur par plateforme et pays. Réinitialiser le produit remplace les données actuelles. Cette fonction ne conserve pas les données par lot. Google Fonts reçoit des informations de connexion telles que votre IP. Les exports sont téléchargés localement."}, "de": {"MarginForge is a Marketplace Profit & Pricing Engine by bumblebee-46. Use Selling Price Engine to find a target price, or Margin Engine to review profit at a current price. Calculations use the agreed v2.1 marketplace rules.": "MarginForge ist ein Preis- und Gewinnrechner von bumblebee-46. Nutzen Sie den Verkaufspreisrechner für eine Zielmarge oder den Margenrechner zur Prüfung eines aktuellen Preises. Berechnungen folgen den vereinbarten Regeln v2.1.", "Product inputs and bulk calculations are processed in your browser. This app does not upload your product data to a server. Theme preferences, fee profiles and single-product inputs (including product identifiers and costs) are stored in this browser. Inputs are saved separately for each marketplace and country. Reset product replaces the current saved inputs. Bulk data is not saved by the input-memory feature. Google Fonts is requested from its provider; that request exposes standard connection information such as your IP address. Interface language preferences are stored in this browser. Exported files are downloaded locally.": "Produktdaten und Stapelberechnungen werden im Browser verarbeitet und nicht an einen Server gesendet. Design, Sprache, Profile und Einzelproduktdaten (Kennungen und Kosten) werden hier je Marktplatz und Land gespeichert. Produkt zurücksetzen ersetzt aktuelle Daten. Diese Funktion speichert keine Stapeldaten. Google Fonts erhält Verbindungsdaten wie Ihre IP-Adresse. Exporte werden lokal heruntergeladen."}};for(const lang of ['es','fr','de']){Object.assign(localeDictionary[lang],translatedFooterParagraphs[lang]);localePatterns[lang]=new RegExp(Object.keys(localeDictionary[lang]).sort((a,b)=>b.length-a.length).map(escapeLocaleRegex).join('|'),'g');}applyInterfaceLanguage();
